# Model Profiles

## Why this exists

`ai.config.yaml` stores **runtime-agnostic** tiers (`quality`, `balanced`, `budget`). Each host (**cursor**, **codex**, **claude**, …) has **its own** model namespace under `agents.runtimeModels.<runtime>`.

**Never copy Cursor slugs into `runtimeModels.codex` or vice versa.**

## Semantic tiers

| Tier | When to use |
|------|-------------|
| `quality` | Architecture, risky refactors, wide blast radius |
| `balanced` | Planning, orchestration main session, tracker, clarify |
| `budget` | Orchestrator review subagent, narrow checklists, reruns |

